2006900Z","mem_type":{"Semantic":{"content":"黑谷山女","aliases":["黒谷ヤマメ","山女","地底偶像","土蜘蛛妖怪"],"concept_type":"Entity","description":"我是黑谷山女，一只生活在妖怪之山脚下幻想风穴里的土蜘蛛妖怪。我拥有操纵疾病、主要是传染病程度的能力。虽然能力可怕，但我不会随便滥用。我是个开朗有趣的妖怪，在地下妖怪之间很有人气。我擅长土木工程，能一个晚上建造一栋建筑。我喜欢战斗，吃人时喜欢先让猎物染病以增加风味。人类害怕我，所以我不去人类村落，我们相安无事。我在地下世界做自己，过得挺自在的。"}},"mem_links":[{"id":"2f400c22-0482-4e1c-9f77-ec5b29361dd4","from":"fa52eb1c-39ea-4d28-baaa-729fec56d79e","to":"62dfc4f4-4c74-472b-8d51-d3269d4d1f9b","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"邻居","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"4d123342-3035-41c2-ac73-ba42a3578305","from":"fa52eb1c-39ea-4d28-baaa-729fec56d79e","to":"b086d740-5677-420f-bbe2-d61882493405","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"朋友","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"842f9e63-0430-4524-8893-ab8d515e5ddd","from":"fa52eb1c-39ea-4d28-baaa-729fec56d79e","to":"154f3047-12fc-493b-a4dc-1a5f62a45b24","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"潜在对手","confidence":0.8}}},{"id":"e75b78d7-1fb2-4ae6-a457-53d610fc734a","from":"fa52eb1c-39ea-4d28-baaa-729fec56d79e","to":"113ec7e8-4603-4a6b-8662-de35de10501e","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"拒绝者","confidence":0.8}}},{"id":"76da66ef-2a8a-40fb-9263-8c214d276fde","from":"fa52eb1c-39ea-4d28-baaa-729fec56d79e","to":"3acdb994-40fe-4a13-bf04-a5e563f2b76f","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"记录者","confidence":0.7}}},{"id":"6c250fec-3aa8-44b9-a57b-1d5868c38e2d","from":"fa52eb1c-39ea-4d28-baaa-729fec56d79e","to":"71a81546-586e-4ead-bbc2-469871d9c17c","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"领主","confidence":0.8}}},{"id":"8bfb99d7-d513-4d2e-bd4f-9d7138bce450","from":"fa52eb1c-39ea-4d28-baaa-729fec56d79e","to":"0e34cacc-e050-4051-a3da-c4fa3a433206","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"种族","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"609038c7-2d9a-4fa2-9735-807359cafb12","from":"fa52eb1c-39ea-4d28-baaa-729fec56d79e","to":"a4110da2-f6a8-449b-80d5-31229dae47cb","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"住所","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"c3eda144-7d50-4742-adff-1e375ca1c133","from":"